    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perfrictĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		perfrico, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a rubbing</i>, <i>abrasion</i>
			(post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Veg. 1, 35, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1,
				38, 3</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perfrictionibus cum oleo mederi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 18, 69, § 116</span></i>
			 (but perh. the same word as the preced. in the same
		meaning).</div>
